{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18396","headline":"谢真人还旧山 · 范传正","name":"谢真人还旧山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麾盖从仙府，笙歌入旧山。\n水流丹竈缺，云起草堂关。\n白鹿行爲卫，青鸾舞自闲。\n种松鳞未立，移石藓仍斑。\n望路烟霞外，回舆岩岫间。\n岂唯辽海鹤，空叹令威还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"范传正","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}